name: Driver's License — enhanced deck X3
author: corpus
description: >-
  Driver's License gives X3 Mult if you have at least 16 Enhanced cards in your full deck.
  First-shop X3 engine: Marble Joker (Stone each blind), Midas Mask (Gold on face cards),
  Certificate (Enhanced on buy). Vampire is a hard counter — it strips enhancements.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: DriversLicense
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: MarbleJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: MidasMask
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Certificate
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
